  "notes": {
    "semetey-1-2013:p1338:b003:l020": "Түбү жайын түрүлтүп is rendered as unfolding the matter from its root; the idiom means giving a full account.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1338:b003:l028": "Колун алып аркага is translated literally as drawing his arm back; the exact gesture is uncertain.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1338:b004:l023": "калча is retained as Kalcha, a group designation in Bölökbai’s retinue.",
    "semetey-1-2013:p1338:b004:l025": "кыяматтык эр is rendered as a friend unto doomsday, meaning a sworn lifelong friend."
